      "id": "intune_detection_script",
      "command_line": "powershell.exe -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -WindowStyle Hidden -File \"C:\\Program Files\\Vendor\\detect.ps1\"",
      "note": "Intune detection scripts run hidden by design. Hidden window plus policy bypass is a genuinely ambiguous pair — and SigmaHQ agrees: this line matches 'Suspicious PowerShell WindowStyle Option', a rule whose whole condition it satisfies. That is the rule author's intent, not an extraction artefact, so it is tolerated rather than suppressed.",
      "tolerated_flags": ["EXEC_POLICY_BYPASS", "HIDDEN_WINDOW", "DETECTION_RULE_MATCH"]
